  {
   "t": "h2",
   "html": "For a beginner to metal detecting lets have a look at stainless digging spades."
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "Metal Detecting digging spades come in all prices, shapes and sizes."
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "Price wise they can be very expensive and some are even very cheap."
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "We tested out a very cheap stainless steel digging spade that was advertised as being very strong, im my mind those 2 words do not go together, so intigued i bought one, from the internet."
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "Looking at the spade in places it seemed reasonable for the price but on closer inspection, i could see places that had flaws in the construction."
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "Undetered i took this out on a day metal detecting to try out, leaving my usually trusty Detecting spade at home.."
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "I wonder how long it will last before the constuction of the spade finally gives way.."
  },
  {
   "t": "h3",
   "html": "What are your thoughts on cheap digging tools?",
   "inferred": true
  }
